# Every link of the passkey/QR chain (bridge, portal, credentialsd, its UI, the Firefox helper, the Firefox
# prefs) restarts and repairs itself: systemd drop-ins restart a dead service at once, `health` (run by a
# timer) repairs what systemd cannot see (hung, missing D-Bus interface, stuck request) and tells the user
# when the ESP32 proxy is offline, `heal-prefs` (run by a path unit) puts the Firefox prefs back.
LIBEXEC_DIR = HOME / ".local/libexec/passkey-qr"
